    "detailed_description": "Dive into the adrenaline-pumping realm of illegal racing, where every turn is an opportunity to showcase your skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/abfdfb31f281b36fa0c4c965486e8bab.avif?t=1729600045\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><br>In Neon Rush, you begin your story as a struggling mechanic barely making ends meet. You find your opportunity in an illegal street race as a way to earn some money. After buying your first car from a junkyard, you embark on your journey in the underworld street racing community. Will you become the best?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/79f1314727491b5ea332e83b41a830c8.avif?t=1729600045\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><br>Taking part in illegal races will attract the attention of the Neon City Police Department! If you want to succeed as a racer in Neon City, you must be faster than they are!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/bbb2c4e9e958a74eccce82220c404636.poster.avif?t=1729600045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/bbb2c4e9e958a74eccce82220c404636.webm?t=1729600045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/bbb2c4e9e958a74eccce82220c404636.mp4?t=1729600045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/e28d41ee87de9d6f184f0d4381f303d2.avif?t=1729600045\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><br>You will be able to take part in many different races across Neon City, such as:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Street Races</li><li>Track Races</li><li>Sprints</li><li>Time Attacks</li><li>Drift</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/3d87ec3395d18818c35963f0ede8a264.avif?t=1729600045\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><br>You will be able to buy different cars, and for each one, you will have the option to modify it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/6b5fc0f13af53060489b7205f3c7f39c.poster.avif?t=1729600045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/6b5fc0f13af53060489b7205f3c7f39c.webm?t=1729600045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/6b5fc0f13af53060489b7205f3c7f39c.mp4?t=1729600045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Dive into the adrenaline-pumping realm of illegal racing, where every turn is an opportunity to showcase your skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/abfdfb31f281b36fa0c4c965486e8bab.avif?t=1729600045\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><br>In Neon Rush, you begin your story as a struggling mechanic barely making ends meet. You find your opportunity in an illegal street race as a way to earn some money. After buying your first car from a junkyard, you embark on your journey in the underworld street racing community. Will you become the best?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/79f1314727491b5ea332e83b41a830c8.avif?t=1729600045\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><br>Taking part in illegal races will attract the attention of the Neon City Police Department! If you want to succeed as a racer in Neon City, you must be faster than they are!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/bbb2c4e9e958a74eccce82220c404636.poster.avif?t=1729600045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/bbb2c4e9e958a74eccce82220c404636.webm?t=1729600045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/bbb2c4e9e958a74eccce82220c404636.mp4?t=1729600045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/e28d41ee87de9d6f184f0d4381f303d2.avif?t=1729600045\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><br>You will be able to take part in many different races across Neon City, such as:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Street Races</li><li>Track Races</li><li>Sprints</li><li>Time Attacks</li><li>Drift</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/3d87ec3395d18818c35963f0ede8a264.avif?t=1729600045\" width=600 height=125 /></span><br><br>You will be able to buy different cars, and for each one, you will have the option to modify it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/6b5fc0f13af53060489b7205f3c7f39c.poster.avif?t=1729600045\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/6b5fc0f13af53060489b7205f3c7f39c.webm?t=1729600045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766280/extras/6b5fc0f13af53060489b7205f3c7f39c.mp4?t=1729600045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Speed through a neon city in this 2D retro racing game. Outsmart cops and rivals with skillful maneuvers. Immerse yourself in illegal racing, fueled by synthwave beats, and dominate as the underworld's top racer!",
